{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10014_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:940355e64d168615be3e1de1aa8c430da0df0ee5b02e0f8eb4197e800480d62a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4",
      "text": "录制结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d5754fd4a959fe87095fb74f51cfb26f566b3a3108de3f4f85b3a6274589b8e",
      "text": "录制辛苦了！\n到下一次开始之前，先稍微休息一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5147312ea0dedf4514b477d19cc38c52da996262fbb509b1650ec238b9c3f07",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●监督也辛苦了。\n悠介，下次最后的定点姿势选什么主题？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a926e0491f2bace2e5e980848ce8427a5ecde2dd8ffa5db7dfea8592683e840",
      "text": "也跟孩子们商量看看吧。\n我也想快点和他们打成一片嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6109bd2d05d6360bcecf65ea0145d5f42b01da6c3702560142e118f9fbaf4ec",
      "text": "悠介君、享介君！\n辛苦了。那个，现在方便吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:340e4169fc24353c1b9c21a46328e56a5c90f54b206676e769103aa4771f43fb",
      "text": "你是……刚才说马上就要当哥哥的\n那个孩子对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffd43f1a196bad8392ceb1b7862edbb5bb3579bcf6b87255c7e64985456c7db1",
      "text": "嗯。悠介君之前说，当哥哥的事随时可以来问，\n所以我就过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82e2095dff33a27da6957da319ede8402437e1bdbf2f21f683b3c37062f02eff",
      "text": "我想在弟弟或妹妹出生前，变成帅气的\n哥哥！要怎么做才能变成那样呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f10e051333c71cd1f0508f7d655e0164f768c566795ef55868fa7a320b0a458",
      "text": "原来如此。既然这样，那就交给从出生开始就一直\n当享介哥哥的我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:169bac2cc80ab727aacb9210d3876bc5188d24cabb7719ccfe0904f08a86f8a2",
      "text": "哇啊，谢谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46989c5975378b2c62129d54f1451c8dd940fb117be112e6816c7e3be14c9716",
      "text": "既然是来向两位请教的，我就先回避一下吧。\n有什么事请随时联系我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:380a0cf692537743a68702f78b2ee9ecbfae1ec00e68445d7ec27630dd49ad08",
      "text": "嗯，知道了。\n谢谢●●●●●●●●●●监督。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c0f4877cd379e5cec4c4a006ceec0c060e2948323cb3b50a9eb989696bd5526",
      "text": "悠介要教怎么当哥哥的话，那我就来教从弟弟\n视角看怎样的哥哥才算帅气，怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d4a143d9dd9d7afe010aec2adec279d891c04b41cb1a33d93ba8a907d672f2a",
      "text": "哎，什么啊，我现在就想听！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_c:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35fd2564889aec42ef937886fcf0e17182b6df19276836ca9d5bcf090a0a8a06",
      "text": "等会儿再说啦。悠介你觉得帅气的哥哥是什么样的，\n应该先讲这个吧？请正牌哥哥先讲。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
